      "decision_input_prefix": "Runtime-prepared market decision snapshot. Use the snapshot as the complete market context. Do not take any trades when the Slope_S value is within ±0.3 of the zero line. This range indicates low market movement and invalid trade conditions.\nReturn strict JSON only.",
